---
name: sort
---

# sort

Sorts a list of floats into ascending order (insertion sort). Duplicates
are kept; the result is a permutation of the input.

```soil-sig
sort : (xs : List F64) -> List F64
```

```ensures
length-preserved: len(result) == len(xs)
```

```test orders
([3.0, 1.0, 2.0]) => [1.0, 2.0, 3.0]
([]) => []
([2.0, 1.0, 1.0]) => [1.0, 1.0, 2.0]
```
